{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Use this prompt with **Shopify AI** (Impulse theme). It is written to recreate the section while giving it a premium **black luxury theme** instead of the white version.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify AI Prompt – Black Theme "Why Choose Us / Growth Focused" Section
    
    Create a premium Shopify section called **"Growth Focused"** with a modern black luxury aesthetic. The section should be fully customizable from the Shopify Theme Editor and optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    
    ## Overall Style
    
    * Background: #050505
    * Secondary Card Background: #0F0F10
    * Border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
    * Card Hover Border: #4F8CFF
    * Primary Text: #FFFFFF
    * Secondary Text: #A3A3A3
    * Accent Color: #4F8CFF
    * Soft blue glow on hover
    * Premium minimal appearance
    * Smooth rounded corners (18px)
    * Large spacing
    * Apple-inspired clean UI
    * No gradients
    * No heavy shadows
    * Elegant micro interactions
    
    ---
    
    ## Section Layout
    
    Centered heading area
    
    Small Label
    
    GROWTH FOCUSED
    
    Large Heading
    
    Why Brands Choose RootSyntax
    
    Description
    
    From strategy to development, every project is built with performance, scalability, and long-term growth in mind.
    
    Maximum width:
    1200px
    
    Section Padding
    
    Desktop
    120px Top
    120px Bottom
    
    Tablet
    80px
    
    Mobile
    60px
    
    ---
    
    ## Cards Layout
    
    Desktop
    
    3 Columns
    
    2 Rows
    
    6 Cards
    
    Tablet
    
    2 Columns
    
    Mobile
    
    1 Column
    
    Gap
    
    32px
    
    ---
    
    ## Card Design
    
    Background
    
    #111111
    
    Border Radius
    
    18px
    
    Border
    
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    
    Padding
    
    40px
    
    Minimum Height
    
    340px
    
    Display
    
    Flex Column
    
    Items Center
    
    Text Center
    
    Transition
    
    0.35s ease
    
    Hover Effects
    
    Lift card upward 10px
    
    Border changes to blue
    
    Soft blue shadow
    
    Icon scales to 108%
    
    Title changes to white
    
    Small blue glow appears behind icon
    
    ---
    
    ## Card Content
    
    Top
    
    Custom SVG Icon
    
    Size
    
    70px
    
    Circle icon container
    
    80px
    
    Background
    
    rgba(79,140,255,.08)
    
    Below Icon
    
    Heading
    
    22px
    
    Font Weight
    
    700
    
    Spacing
    
    24px
    
    Description
    
    16px
    
    Line Height
    
    1.8
    
    Color
    
    #B8B8B8
    
    Centered
    
    Bottom
    
    Small animated blue arrow
    
    ↓
    
    On hover
    
    Arrow slides upward slightly
    
    ---
    
    ## Default Cards
    
    ### Organized Code
    
    Icon:
    Code Monitor
    
    Description
    
    We write clean, scalable, and maintainable Shopify code following best practices, making future updates faster and easier.
    
    ---
    
    ### Growth Focused
    
    Icon:
    Target
    
    Description
    
    Every Shopify store is designed with conversion optimization, performance, and long-term business growth in mind.
    
    ---
    
    ### Fast Response Time
    
    Icon:
    Clock + Chat
    
    Description
    
    Our team responds quickly to project updates, feedback, and support requests to keep your business moving without delays.
    
    ---
    
    ### On-Time Delivery
    
    Icon:
    Checklist
    
    Description
    
    Projects are delivered according to milestones with transparent communication and quality assurance throughout the process.
    
    ---
    
    ### SEO Optimized
    
    Icon:
    Magnifying Glass
    
    Description
    
    Every Shopify build follows technical SEO best practices, helping your store achieve better visibility and faster indexing.
    
    ---
    
    ### Ongoing Support
    
    Icon:
    Support
    
    Description
    
    We continue supporting your Shopify store after launch with updates, optimization, maintenance, and technical assistance.
    
    ---
    
    ## Animations
    
    Entire section fades in while scrolling.
    
    Cards animate one after another.
    
    Duration
    
    500ms
    
    Delay
    
    80ms
    
    Hover duration
    
    300ms
    
    Smooth GPU accelerated transitions.
    
    ---
    
    ## Theme Editor Settings
    
    Allow editing
    
    * Section Heading
    * Section Subheading
    * Description
    * Background Color
    * Accent Color
    * Card Background
    * Card Border Radius
    * Card Padding
    * Number of Columns
    * Animation On/Off
    
    Each card should allow editing
    
    * Icon (SVG upload)
    * Title
    * Description
    * Link (optional)
    * Icon Color
    * Hover Color
    
    Unlimited cards using Shopify Blocks.
    
    ---
    
    ## Performance Requirements
    
    * Use native Shopify Liquid only.
    * No external libraries.
    * No jQuery.
    * Responsive with CSS Grid.
    * Lazy-load SVG assets where applicable.
    * Minimal DOM structure.
    * WCAG AA accessible.
    * Fast rendering with optimized CSS.
    
    ---
    
    ## Design Goal
    
    The final result should feel like a premium Shopify agency website with a luxury black interface similar to Linear, Vercel, Stripe, and Apple's dark design language. The cards should be spacious, elegant, highly interactive, and conversion-focused while preserving the same grid layout as the reference image with a significantly more modern and premium appearance.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-growth-focused-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_desktop }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_desktop }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.5s ease forwards;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ block.settings.columns_desktop }}, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    min-height: 340px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.35s ease;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    will-change: transform, border-color, box-shadow;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_animations %}
    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1) {
      animation: ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.5s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.08s;
    }
    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
      animation: ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.5s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.16s;
    }
    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
      animation: ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.5s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.24s;
    }
    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(4) {
      animation: ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.5s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.32s;
    }
    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(5) {
      animation: ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.5s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.4s;
    }
    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(6) {
      animation: ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.5s ease forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.48s;
    }
  {% else %}
    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    border-color: {{ block.settings.card_hover_border }};
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-growth-focused-icon-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.08);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-growth-focused-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-growth-focused-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-icon-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_background }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 70px;
    height: 70px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-growth-focused-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-size: 20px;
    opacity: 0.6;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  @keyframes ai-growth-focused-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-growth-focused-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_tablet }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 300px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-growth-focused-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px 16px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px;
      min-height: 280px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-icon-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-growth-focused-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

